WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.160
And we're halfway done right there.

2
00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.480
We've got 25 seconds left to go.

3
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:27.600
Keep those feet moving and keep those squats nice and low.

4
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:28.960
And we're almost done.

5
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:33.880
We've got just five seconds left till we switch to high knees, another 50 seconds of these,

6
00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:34.880
and switch it up.

7
00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.160
Drive those knees up nice and high.

8
00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.600
Remember trying to get them at least to hip height.

9
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.640
Try to keep those feet off the ground for as long as you can, barely letting that foot

10
00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.080
touch before you're pulling it right back up again.

11
00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:58.440
Just keep those lungs open and keep those feet moving.

12
00:00:58.440 --> 00:00:59.440
And that's halfway.

13
00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:00.440
Keep those feet moving.
